2. webhooks.ts: sets principalAgencyId only, same send shape
3. agencies.ts: DIFFERENT — returns principalResult.data or null (used as a per-route helper `await requirePrincipalAgency(request, reply)` — not an onRequest hook), uses sendError
4. access-requests.ts: sets both, same send shape

Common core: 401/403 mapping + fallback error. Differences: agencies variant returns data instead of mutating request. Design of shared preHandler:

